<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan forces have forced Haftar militia members to surrender at a strategic airbase while continuing artillery attacks on Haftar posts, and Turkish officials have publicly welcomed a motion supporting the troops. An armed group blocked the Hamada oil pipeline for over 20 days, causing losses of more than $30 million. An explosion hit an ammunition depot at the Benghazi naval base. China is re-engaging in Libya with military forces linked to recent business deals. The United Nations introduced laws criminalising child conscription and raising the recruitment age to 18, and there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNWHpSLVlaN0xVeVJYWFhVWlBfdHNldmJpMHFoRG9jNWFMTEE3UktOeUNtdmhuVFBNc0RJNFhlTkdJdzhja2YzZ2FuZS01UEw1WE5YS2tGWDdlYlFJOS1wSk5EcmdqeHE1aGlYNnp6UE5kcXhoZzEyWUNXOUU0NmppenNyMkY4TlVvTmNEZEQ0a2tKaU4xWXc2MTE0YkViQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQRUR4ZjV2cXhJTThFVzBWWmtId2c2MEJKTDNhUUdZVmhIdGtOYjViSmIyLXhvMWxELUhqZHdjWWFPLXJibWFjNi03Ynh1WGJXN1ZhVnhsVVdSaW4wQlFXZGV6bVkwbUpxWTVPVGFyQWE2Ri1zUVNxYkM0Q0tFa2EydWdxZnhrMHJWQ1RMREdJOWpMVDRKVGQzUFFUV0txZG9VaWQxUmhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE5qMEV4ZkhQdVBnSzNJY0ZXRlhBblhQbS1tQ2kwaEVyMUtwb3NyZmU3WUItaEkweW16ckRLZHJXbE9qRzcyUF9fVVFqMVQzV2JzMk41dmtyVU5tMnZnVmdIWEZSVGVTYWt2N2FyenpBN2VhbHA0WjVGSy1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;cedarnews.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;A News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;A News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNTURUTmJETVdad2xyNm5xTF85dEg0VTVsaFl5aDBCMXJmWHh5cTJwcVhFajI5UGxBWUFZbkIzYzhSdWVvRk